      "title": "Here's Why You Should Retain DaVita Stock in Your Portfolio for Now",
      "summary": "DaVita (DVA) has rallied 55.8% year-to-date, driven by strong Integrated Kidney Care (IKC) platform growth, improving treatment volumes, and technology investments. The company beat Q2 expectations by $40 million in adjusted operating income and raised full-year guidance. However, persistent headwinds include declining revenue per treatment due to commercial-mix pressure (estimated $70 million impact in 2027), elevated G&A costs limiting operating leverage, and limited acquisition opportunities in a consolidated market.",
